01:28:28.870 --> 01:28:29.871
Enggak.

01:28:30.104 --> 01:28:31.105
Lepaskan.

01:29:16.918 --> 01:29:19.921
Bajingan.

01:29:51.486 --> 01:29:53.087
Wah, warnanya bagus ya.

01:29:54.389 --> 01:30:04.465
Kebanyakan kecap ya, sampai kacau
begitu? Bukan karena kebanyakan minum?

01:30:09.170 --> 01:30:14.876
Aku sudah melupakan semua hal yang menyebalkan
itu. Sudahlah. Mau pergi sendiri lagi?

01:30:16.244 --> 01:30:17.245
Gila, keren banget itu.

01:30:17.345 --> 01:30:18.379
Dia itu kuat.

01:30:23.251 --> 01:30:30.324
Selama nikah aku nggak pernah selingkuh,
tapi kali ini aku malah berkhianat.

01:30:33.461 --> 01:30:34.729
Sudah tamat, Scout.

01:30:37.131 --> 01:30:40.101
Ya sudahlah, namanya juga
pengalaman, lupakan saja.

01:30:40.835 --> 01:30:41.202
Ya, betul.

01:30:41.736 --> 01:30:48.042
Jangan dipikirkan. Lupakan tokomu,
ikuti nalurimu dan nikmati alam liar.

01:30:48.309 --> 01:30:50.311
Itulah asyiknya kegiatan alam.

01:30:52.513 --> 01:30:55.082
Tapi, suamimu tipe rumahan, kan?

01:30:55.750 --> 01:30:57.885
Susah kan kalau
noda nggak hilang?

01:30:58.486 --> 01:30:59.487
Enggak kok.

01:31:02.056 --> 01:31:05.526
Tapi, jangan injak base-nya ya.

01:31:17.738 --> 01:31:18.873
Aku nikmati ini.

01:31:20.575 --> 01:31:20.942
Kan?

01:31:21.576 --> 01:31:27.949
Ya. Eh, menarik ya?

01:31:59.347 --> 01:32:00.815
Kasih jawaban sekarang.

01:32:05.853 --> 01:32:07.722
Ada apa ya?

01:32:11.459 --> 01:32:11.893
Gila.

01:32:12.260 --> 01:32:16.831
Orang itu terus-terusan
hubungin gue.

01:32:18.099 --> 01:32:19.634
Hebat ya, bisa menikmati hidup.

01:32:20.902 --> 01:32:22.570
Boleh saja, kan,
bersenang-senang?

01:32:23.271 --> 01:32:24.672
Duh, sudah tegang banget ya.

01:32:25.873 --> 01:32:30.912
Padahal aku suka dia,
tapi malah aku khianati.

01:32:33.681 --> 01:32:35.216
Tada itu jujur ya.

01:32:38.419 --> 01:32:39.720
Kelihatannya enak.

01:32:49.463 --> 01:32:51.632
Vagina itu enak, ya.

01:33:10.551 --> 01:33:12.153
Camilan yang lucu ya.

01:33:21.696 --> 01:33:22.697
Ini,

01:33:27.034 --> 01:33:28.035
Yuk, sikat gigi.

01:33:32.640 --> 01:33:33.641
Oh, begitu.

01:33:35.710 --> 01:33:36.711
Nggak basah kuyup, kok.

01:33:38.546 --> 01:33:39.547
Kira-kira begini, kan?

01:33:46.053 --> 01:33:49.190
Boleh kok, keluarin
aja suaranya.

01:33:49.924 --> 01:33:53.327
Bikin suara kecap-kecap, terus bikin lagi.
Nggak usah kencang-kencang suaranya. Oke.

01:34:16.651 --> 01:34:17.918
Lagi ngapain sih lo?

01:34:30.131 --> 01:34:33.934
Awas, nanti kamu tenggelam.

01:34:41.609 --> 01:34:42.710
Nggak bisa.

01:34:43.044 --> 01:34:45.246
Enggak bisa.

01:34:53.721 --> 01:34:56.157
Basah banget, memekmu.

01:34:56.590 --> 01:34:57.591
Meleleh.

01:34:58.192 --> 01:34:59.660
Ini benar-benar lumer.

01:35:01.896 --> 01:35:03.364
Ekspresimu bagus banget.

01:35:08.936 --> 01:35:09.937
Sakit.

01:35:11.105 --> 01:35:12.106
Sakit.

01:35:13.374 --> 01:35:14.975
Boleh kok kalau mau ajak aku.

01:35:18.879 --> 01:35:19.880
Sakit.

01:35:26.454 --> 01:35:27.555
Ini, Bu.

01:35:32.560 --> 01:35:37.631
Aku juga mau dibuat
nyaman. Gimana?

01:35:40.434 --> 01:35:49.043
Ayo, ngomong sendiri.
Ayo, Bu. Mau gimana?

01:35:50.511 --> 01:35:52.646
Sayang sekali.

01:35:57.885 --> 01:35:59.420
Terserah kamu saja.

01:36:02.957 --> 01:36:04.492
Sikat habis saja.

01:36:04.959 --> 01:36:07.194
Suka, ya?

01:36:07.762 --> 01:36:08.863
Nggak usah yang manis-manis.

01:36:09.530 --> 01:36:20.841
Nggak perlu
kenceng-kenceng. Enak nggak?

01:36:25.212 --> 01:36:26.180
Hebat juga ya.

01:36:30.484 --> 01:36:34.155
Daya hisapnya beda, ya.

01:36:40.261 --> 01:36:42.062
Rasakan juga yang ini.

01:36:54.942 --> 01:36:56.510
Omongin sendiri sana.

01:36:57.278 --> 01:36:58.479
Ketua juga sudah datang, kan.

01:37:10.591 --> 01:37:11.592
Enak, kan.

01:37:25.339 --> 01:37:26.540
Ayo bersenang-senang.

01:37:34.515 --> 01:37:36.350
Kapan-kapan main
ke tempatku sini.

01:37:41.155 --> 01:37:42.723
Iya, iya, iya, iya.

01:38:12.286 --> 01:38:14.321
Aku tunggu ya. Semuanya ke sini.

01:38:22.029 --> 01:38:23.130
Sudah, ikut saja.

01:38:23.764 --> 01:38:24.765
Cuma hari ini saja.

01:38:37.177 --> 01:38:39.446
Memekmu basah kuyup.

01:38:41.916 --> 01:38:43.450
Sini, hisap. Sini, hisap.

01:38:56.530 --> 01:38:57.531
Hebat, hebat.

01:39:08.142 --> 01:39:09.143
Hebat ya.

01:39:15.582 --> 01:39:17.384
Pantatku basah kuyup.

01:39:19.420 --> 01:39:21.822
Harus dijilatin sampai puas, ya.

01:39:31.699 --> 01:39:33.400
Jangan ngaco.

01:39:34.702 --> 01:39:36.270
Dihisap sampai enak.

01:39:36.971 --> 01:39:38.372
Kamu mirip sekali
dengan suamimu.

01:39:42.943 --> 01:39:43.944
Hebat juga.

01:39:48.782 --> 01:39:51.285
Sambil memuaskan
istrimu juga ya.

01:39:59.626 --> 01:40:02.563
Sayang, naiklah ke atas wajahku.

01:40:11.338 --> 01:40:13.040
Aku yang sungkan.

01:40:44.471 --> 01:40:45.773
Dasar mesum.

01:40:47.841 --> 01:40:49.977
Sudah waktunya, kan?

01:40:53.047 --> 01:40:54.248
Jadi pengen?

01:40:55.616 --> 01:40:56.617
Isap punya gue.

01:40:58.385 --> 01:40:59.553
Bokongnya naikkin.

01:41:18.472 --> 01:41:19.473
Dua-duanya ada.

01:41:20.574 --> 01:41:21.942
Lama tidak jumpa.

01:41:34.855 --> 01:41:37.858
Hari ini kita lanjut lagi.

01:42:06.820 --> 01:42:08.222
Dasar mesum.

01:42:11.158 --> 01:42:14.061
Pendarahannya sudah kau
tekan dengan benar, kan?

01:42:24.605 --> 01:42:25.772
Pak, lihat ke sini.

01:42:27.007 --> 01:42:28.242
Aku mau lihat wajah Sensei.

01:42:42.523 --> 01:42:43.857
Wajahmu bagus sekali.

01:42:44.258 --> 01:42:45.292
Hebat juga ya, Nyonya.

01:42:47.661 --> 01:42:48.996
Ini buatmu juga.

01:43:06.013 --> 01:43:08.081
Telur, mantap banget.

01:43:32.306 --> 01:43:33.874
Aku ingin mencicipi
batang yang lain.

01:43:34.841 --> 01:43:35.842
Banyak, kok.

01:43:39.012 --> 01:43:40.013
Jadi pengen.

01:43:40.614 --> 01:43:42.916
Boleh kok jadi gila. Enggak
kok, kamu enggak gila.

01:43:50.757 --> 01:43:52.693
Tunjukkan wajah
nikmatmu pada Sensei.

01:43:54.494 --> 01:43:56.029
Cukup nikmati saja
untuk semalam ini.

01:44:14.548 --> 01:44:17.184
Enggak mau, enggak
mau, enggak mau.

01:44:18.352 --> 01:44:22.489
Enak, lho. Mau dijilat bagian mana pun
dari tubuh Sensei, rasanya enak semua.

01:44:26.560 --> 01:44:28.161
Semuanya dianggap
remeh sama kalian.

01:44:45.912 --> 01:44:47.114
Mantap, Sensei.

01:44:50.917 --> 01:45:09.102
Nyonya, sekarang hadap ke
sini. Hadap ke sini. Ada apa?

01:45:09.136 --> 01:45:14.141
Nggak bergerak. Ada apa?

01:45:14.508 --> 01:45:15.509
Ada apa?

01:45:16.310 --> 01:45:19.413
Harus kukasih tahu apa
yang terjadi. Ada apa?

01:45:52.245 --> 01:45:53.980
Aku ingin dengar
suara bagus Sensei.

01:45:54.514 --> 01:45:55.749
Lebih hati-hati, Sensei.

01:46:14.468 --> 01:46:19.172
Hadap sana.

01:46:21.675 --> 01:46:23.443
Wajahmu bagus sekali.

01:46:24.244 --> 01:46:25.245
Keren banget.

01:46:46.266 --> 01:46:48.435
Lakukan saja sesukamu.

01:46:50.036 --> 01:46:51.037
Coba gerak.

01:46:52.572 --> 01:46:53.140
Boleh.

01:46:53.440 --> 01:46:55.409
Silakan bergerak
sesukamu, Sensei.

01:46:56.042 --> 01:47:09.456
Coba tebak di mana. Ada apa?

01:47:09.556 --> 01:47:11.191
Mau aku lihatin pantatku?

01:47:16.797 --> 01:47:18.131
Satu saja kurang, ya?

01:47:19.833 --> 01:47:20.834
Kurang, ya.

01:47:27.941 --> 01:47:29.376
Gawat, gawat.

01:47:40.787 --> 01:47:42.322
Gila, lihai banget goyangannya.

01:47:44.424 --> 01:47:45.692
Bergeraklah. Ayo, terus.

01:47:46.460 --> 01:47:47.461
Mencurigakan.

01:47:48.261 --> 01:47:49.729
Ayo kita nikmati sama-sama.

01:47:58.972 --> 01:48:00.006
Gila, gila, gila.

01:48:05.011 --> 01:48:06.012
Gue isap.

01:48:07.280 --> 01:48:08.281
Nyonya.

01:48:09.983 --> 01:48:23.497
Puaskan aku. Mau lagi?

01:48:29.302 --> 01:48:32.839
Sudah waktunya... katakan
saja. Kamu jadi jujur, ya?

01:48:34.941 --> 01:48:37.711
Lupakan saja soal suamimu itu.

01:48:41.948 --> 01:48:42.949
Aku mau.

01:48:43.583 --> 01:48:44.584
Oke.

01:48:45.051 --> 01:48:46.052
Oke.

01:48:46.953 --> 01:48:47.254
Nih.

01:48:47.754 --> 01:48:48.755
Ayo, ayo, ayo.

01:49:31.531 --> 01:49:32.699
Hentikan.

01:49:42.943 --> 01:49:44.544
Sudah berakhir.

01:49:45.445 --> 01:49:46.446
Habis sudah.

01:49:48.148 --> 01:49:49.149
Selesai sudah.

01:49:49.716 --> 01:49:50.717
Nggak.

01:50:30.557 --> 01:50:31.558
Penuh

01:50:39.966 --> 01:50:40.967
Bisa gawat nih.

01:50:41.468 --> 01:50:42.469
Apa?

01:50:43.403 --> 01:50:44.537
Apa yang jadi penuh?

01:50:44.838 --> 01:50:46.506
Bisa kekenyangan nanti.

01:50:46.773 --> 01:50:47.774
Apa?

01:50:47.974 --> 01:50:48.975
Plong, ya?

01:50:50.577 --> 01:50:52.045
Biar kupenuhi kamu.

01:51:03.523 --> 01:51:04.491
Hei.

01:51:15.068 --> 01:51:17.103
Soalnya itu kenyal banget.

01:51:18.772 --> 01:51:19.873
Pinggangku nggak
bisa berhenti goyang nih.

01:51:23.043 --> 01:51:25.145
Gerak pelan saja,
sentuh pelan saja.

01:51:26.112 --> 01:51:27.447
Pelan-pelan, nah gitu, iya.

01:51:29.215 --> 01:51:30.950
Gerak pelan-pelan ya.

01:51:41.461 --> 01:51:43.496
Lagi santai banget nih.

01:51:46.232 --> 01:51:47.534
Begitu saja, tahan, ayo.

01:51:48.968 --> 01:51:50.103
Coba tebak di mana, ayo.

01:51:55.909 --> 01:51:56.910
Di situ ya masalahnya.

01:51:58.111 --> 01:51:59.112
Di sini, kan?

01:52:00.180 --> 01:52:01.314
Sakit.

01:52:06.920 --> 01:52:08.188
Panas.

01:52:08.455 --> 01:52:10.090
Ayo pergi. Panas. Ayo pergi.

01:52:45.091 --> 01:52:47.460
Kebanyakan, nih.

01:52:52.165 --> 01:52:53.767
Banyak banget, lho.

01:52:54.334 --> 01:52:55.335
Berhenti.

01:52:55.668 --> 01:53:00.640
Gak sanggup lagi.
Aku juga harus gimana?

01:53:02.408 --> 01:53:03.409
Nikmati saja.

01:53:10.850 --> 01:53:59.199
Ayo pergi. Kita cari
kesenangan. Ada apa?

01:54:00.934 --> 01:54:02.836
Ada apa?

01:54:09.676 --> 01:54:10.677
Ada apa?

01:54:10.710 --> 01:54:11.711
Ini yang pertama dan terakhir.

01:54:16.850 --> 01:55:24.751
Nah, wajahmu mulai
terlihat bagus. Bagaimana?

01:55:27.420 --> 01:55:28.421
Kondisi mentalnya?

01:55:30.223 --> 01:55:31.858
Sudah puas kakinya?

01:55:31.991 --> 01:57:18.131
Ayo, tanda tangani ini sebagai
kenang-kenangan. Halo?

01:57:19.966 --> 01:57:22.835
Aku sudah jemput, di mana kamu?

01:57:26.039 --> 01:57:27.240
Ah, maaf.

01:57:27.340 --> 01:57:30.643
Gue belum bisa pulang
sekarang. Maksud lo apa?

01:57:34.180 --> 01:57:35.581
Kayaknya sinyalnya jelek, deh.

01:57:37.884 --> 01:57:38.885
Maaf.

01:57:42.989 --> 01:57:45.391
Ark, nggak apa-apa nggak pulang?
